language sdl-mvp1-exercise version 0.1.

capability BuckingDiagnostics.
functionality ObserveBuckingHistory.
functionality ServeBuckingLabRequests.
functionality RouteAptAdminCommand.

BuckingLab cites "https://github.com/Hans-Einar/ponsse/blob/7589a5811a21ec6bb13979612060ceff0f690df8/MVP1/services/bucking-lab/SDP/03--Requirements/requirements.md".
BuckingLab provides BuckingDiagnostics.
BuckingLab owns ObserveBuckingHistory.
ObserveBuckingHistory realizes BuckingDiagnostics.
ObserveBuckingHistory specifies "Normal Bucking v1 client; recent history/optional NDJSON with service, event and revision lineage; no production authority.".
BuckingLab owns ServeBuckingLabRequests.
ServeBuckingLabRequests realizes BuckingDiagnostics.
ServeBuckingLabRequests specifies "LabKit checkpoint, bounded artifact and configured isolated replay with explicit capabilities and request IDs.".
BuckingLab owns RouteAptAdminCommand.
RouteAptAdminCommand realizes BuckingDiagnostics.
RouteAptAdminCommand specifies "buckctl load submits Bucking import; save obtains authoritative export then writes locally; never edits owner storage directly.".
